# Files that domain substitution leaves out, one per line, as paths in
# ungoogled-chromium's domain_substitution.list. Only files that name the
# Chrome Web Store's addresses, or the XML namespace of its update responses,
# belong here (arc-extension-experience, D1). Substituted, the real store isn't
# the store: it gets no install API, and no update response parses.
extensions/browser/updater/safe_manifest_parser.cc
extensions/common/api/_api_features.json
extensions/common/extension_urls.cc
